      "$comment": [
        "Pillar 4 \u2014 ablation matrix, split by theme so each flag runs in a",
        "scenario that can actually exercise it.  Replaces the original",
        "single-scenario design that left ~14/22 flags inert (their gating",
        "conditions \u2014 CPs, voltage stress, heat sector, line overload,",
        "Hebbian warmup, etc. \u2014 never fired in the concentrated-5 LV regime).",
        "Each block names the flag set it tests + the scenario that triggers",
        "them; the {} default in each block is the per-block baseline."
      ],
      "name": "ablation_core",
      "$comment_block": "Holonic / QP-gossip / priority core.  Concentrated 5-failure on simbench_lv drives the deficit-heavy holon ADMM, gossip, and priority-allocation paths.",
